    "title": "Manhattan motorcyclist air-lifted to hospital after struck by pickup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Manhattan\nManhattan motorcyclist air-lifted to hospital after struck by pickup\n13 hours ago\nRILEY COUNTY—One person was injured in an accident just after 7:30a.m. Tuesday in Riley County. According to the Riley County Police Department activity report, a 2012 Chevy Silverado driven by Ysidoro Martinez Arguello, 55, of Manhattan was traveling in the 400 Block of Levee Drive. The pickup struck a 2015 Harley Davidson Motorcycle driven by Donald Taylor, 71, of Manhattan.",
